 "novel_title": "美人之棋步天下", "content_zh": "第八章 被狼群围攻的人当厚厚的云层覆盖整个白虎山，压抑的气息立刻传来，似乎要将这里的一切污垢全部消除干净。齐琳知道，这样的气氛，和大扫除之前的准备是一样的，浓厚的灰尘使得整个呼吸道都无法正常工作，只能躲在厚厚的口罩下面，悲催的呼吸着过滤过的空气。狼群忽然之间就从丛林中窜出来，毫无预兆的，一瞬间就出来了。秦潇拔出长剑，全身的细胞全都进入紧张状态，面对这百匹狼，仿佛回到了那个漆黑的夜晚。那是他的一时大意犯下的打错，现在便是弥补之时了。屏气凝神，准备攻击，却被人拉住。秦潇怒视面前的人，开口道“让开。”梁虎紧紧的握住秦潇的手，十分严肃的开口道“现在可不是命令别人的时候，看清楚了，这些狼群只是在拦着我们的去路，若是我们离开的话，是不会有生命危险的，但是你要是硬闯的话，别说受伤了，可能全尸都不可能了。”这狼群出现的太突然，而且一出现就是上百，梁虎不管怎么想都想不出这之前它们都藏到哪里去了。而且狼群的出现似乎只是为了拦住他们的去路，在保护什么东西么？难道说，这里面真的有什么妖女存在？“就在前面。”秦潇淡淡的说道，深邃的目光却紧紧的盯着前方，他感觉得到，从前方传过来的不一样的气息，就是他要找的人，但是狼群竟然在这个时候出现，难道说自己一时找的理由竟然成真了？“你们先离开，我掩护。”话是这么说，秦潇其实只是想让他们先行离去，自己再作打算，总之今天是不可能空手而归，至少要探个虚实，说不定他们口中的妖女便是那天晚上的刺客，能够控制狼群的人，至今为止只有一个人，但是那个人已经销声匿迹七年了，怎么可能出现，若是余党，也不可能控制到这种地步。唯一的可能，也是最不可能的可能。逍遥王，白千烨回来了。此时，距离白虎山百里之遥的地方，一队人马正慢慢前进，锦旗飘扬，像是在诉说着胜利的经过。“报~”一个身着红色战衣的小卒骑着快马从远处跑到队伍的最前面，迅速的跳下马，单膝跪在地上。“禀告王爷，前方白虎山处出现大量的猎人，据说是在围剿妖女。”为首的男子微微皱眉，看了看白虎山那边，一抹笑意渐渐爬上嘴角。继而发出命令“回去启禀皇上，我安邦王凯旋而归，先经过白虎山，愿意为吾皇分忧，围剿妖女。”“遵命。”小卒得到命令，快速的跳上马背，离开。“王爷，这样真的可以吗？”看着安邦王饶有兴趣的脸，旁边的黑衣有些不解，现在不是应该先回朝接受奖赏么？而且一向不爱插手管闲事的王爷今日竟然要去围剿白虎山的什么妖女，真是可笑。莫说白虎山了，就说那个妖女究竟存在与否都不清楚。“王爷，白虎山怎么会有妖女？莫不是谣言吧。王爷又何须费心思？”被称为王爷的人只是眯起眼睛，嘴角挂着淡淡的笑容，蓝色衣衫在风中摇摆。许久才说道“卷丹，跟着本王这么多年，竟然还问这么愚蠢的问题。”卷丹为之一愣，王爷虽然没什么太大的表情波动，但是眼里的兴趣却是前所未有的浓厚，想必就算没有皇上的圣旨，他也一定会前往白虎山的吧，真是个任性的王爷。双手抱拳，恭敬的说道“是属下愚笨，还请王爷海涵。”“总之卷丹就是这么死脑筋，所以才会双十年华还单身一人，王爷，依属下之见，丢几个女人给他他也不会享受的。”看见卷丹一脸的囧样，青衣男子也忍不住上前打趣一番“王爷，要不要属下先去探个虚实？”“空青，这样对王爷说话，太放肆了。”虽然是责备的话语，卷丹却一点也不生气，早就已经习惯这样的调侃的他，完全不会在意，当然，也不会担心王爷会发怒。“所以才说你呆板啊，不过???能够让全凤凰城的猎人出动，想必花了不少财力吧。”空青扛着长枪走到最前面，棕色眸子中闪过一丝精光“能够做到这一步的，也就只有那个人了。王爷，空青可否先行一步？”虽然是在请示，但是空青却已经迫不及待的想要冲过去，就连马儿都兴奋的踏动着前蹄，就等着主人的命令。安邦王知道空青一向冲动行事，若要让他慢步过去，恐怕，一路上会埋怨个不停吧，到时候惹是生非也不是不可能的。罢了，难得这次如此顺利，他功不可没。就当做是奖赏如何？“卷丹，接下来就交给你了。”卷丹还没吃透这话语之意，旁边的两人就已经挥鞭扬长而去，留下他一个人在风中凌乱???“扑哧扑哧”鸟儿似乎感觉到不安，奋力的挥动着双翅离开这个是非之地。仅留下几根羽翼，飘落在地上，然后被风带起，继续未知的旅程。秦潇和梁虎等人不停的后退，已经退了百米，狼群却依然步步逼近，没有进攻，也没有罢休的趋势。就像是只需将他们赶出森林而已。身边的杂草越来越多，梁虎一刻也不敢松懈的后退，顺便观察着四周的环境，目测到这里的藤条比较多之后，心生一计。朝着秦潇使了一个眼神，也将自己的意思传达给身边的人，就算不会武功，但是身为猎人，最基本的能力还是有的。退到最接近藤条的地方，众人会意的使劲一条，每人抓住一根藤条，接着藤条的力量翻转到树枝上，稳稳地站好。狼群似乎没有预料到他们的举动，只好仰头看着他们干巴巴的嚎叫。霎时间，百余匹狼同时嚎叫，惊动山中栖息的鸟儿，同时也惊动了不远处的齐琳。回头看了看鸟儿飞出的地方，齐琳大概能够猜出些许情况，大概是遭遇狼群围攻了，就在离她不远的地方???忽然，一个念头闪过齐琳的脑海，突然出现的狼群，被拦住的猎人，似乎都太巧了。巧得她差点以为那些狼群是为了掩护她而出现的。狼群，在保护她？但是这样的念头瞬间破灭，因为，就在齐琳这样想的时候，小白突然停下，警惕的盯着前方。几乎是一瞬间，从杂草中窜出百余匹狼，将她们全部围住。齐琳带出来的狼纷纷朝着小白靠拢，面对数量如此巨大的狼群，就算有小白在，其余的狼也会感到不安的吧。齐琳紧紧的抓住小白的颈毛，大气都不敢出一声，生怕激怒这些狼。几乎是同一时间，所有进来围剿狼群的猎人都遇到了同样的情况，但是奇怪的是，狼群根本没有主动攻击人类的意图。只是一些猎人出于害怕率先动了手，被狼群咬伤，其余的几乎没有伤亡。这简直???简直就是被狼群围剿了。顿时间，狼嚎充斥着整座白虎山，就连山外的人都能够听到这雷鸣般的嚎叫。白虎山周围的动物都害怕的躲起来瑟瑟发抖。就连旅人都惊恐的不敢大声喧哗，加快脚步前进。小卒单膝跪在地上，等候着最后的指令。凤长卿看着明黄色的折子，白纸黑字，真真切切的写明了意图。每一个字都像是上元节的烟火，刺激着他的大脑。真是发生了极其有趣的事情呢。大手一抬，继续逗着鸟儿。视线却没有离开白虎山的方向。凤凰宫殿是依山而建，自下而上有九层，而皇上的宫殿便是在最高层，从这里几乎可以看清一切，包括白虎山，青龙潭，玄武湖。其中白虎山是距离凤凰城最近的山，那伏首的白虎，仿佛随时都盯着这座凤凰城，只待一口吞之。看来，一向沉睡的白虎，也会有不安的时候。这出戏，越来越有趣了，凤长卿眯起眼睛，开口道“安邦王凯旋而归，本应接受嘉奖，却仍然不辞辛苦，为朕解忧，此番心意，实在难得。不愧为我朝的安邦王。传令下去，待安邦王顺利归来之时，文武百官需出城跪拜迎接。”“遵旨。”太监得令，下去开始准备。等到该走的人都走了，方才的笑意凝固在嘴角，手上的力道也瞬间加重，使得手中的鸟儿一阵痛鸣，最后还是承受不住这强大的力道，毙命于此。身上金色的羽毛仍旧在阳光下闪闪发光，熠熠生辉。四周散发着沉闷的气息，静的可怕。齐琳仔细的观察着狼群的动向，没有进攻也没有离开，仿佛只是将他们困在这里，若是顾忌小白的威力，也不会毫无杀气，这样的情形太奇怪了。从来没有遇到过。齐琳自然不会得意的以为是自己的所谓的能够驾驭百兽的能力在此应验了。慢慢的从小白的身上下来，找到其中一条比较年长的狼，齐琳试着挪动步子，见狼群没有异动，便壮着胆子慢慢的接近围攻自己的狼群，她相信，若是狼群有攻击的意图，小白一定会第一时间咬断对方的脖子，所以她不害怕，至少不会很害怕。终于走到看中的那匹狼的面前，在距离它五步之遥的地方停下，齐琳弯下身子，学着古人跪坐在地上，礼貌的低头，然后缓缓开口“我们只是途经此地，或许无意中闯入各位的领域，但是也并无恶意。若是阁下行个方便，让我们就此离去，不伤和气，我等感激不尽。”这是对狼群致以尊敬，齐琳看过一些古老的书，传说只要有灵性的动物都会被供奉起来，遇到的时候只要对其尊重，便可安然无恙。简单的说，她现在是疾病乱投医。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 8: People Besieged by Wolves When thick clouds covered the entire Baihu Mountain, a depressing aura immediately came, as if to eliminate all the dirt here. Qi Lin knew that this atmosphere was the same as the preparations before the general cleaning. The thick dust made it impossible for the entire respiratory tract to work normally. She could only hide under the thick mask and breathe the filtered air miserably. The wolves suddenly burst out of the jungle, without warning, in an instant. Qin Xiao pulled out the long sword, and all the cells in his body entered a state of tension. Facing these hundred wolves, it seemed as if he had returned to that dark night. That was a careless mistake he made, and now is the time to make up for it. Holding his breath and concentrating, he prepared to attack, but was held back. Qin Xiao glared at the person in front of him and said, \"Get out of the way.\" Liang Hu held Qin Xiao's hand tightly and said very seriously, \"Now is not the time to order others. See clearly, these wolves are just blocking our way. If we leave, It's not life-threatening, but if you force your way in, not to mention being injured, all of them may be dead.\" The wolves appeared so suddenly, and there were hundreds of them when they appeared. No matter how hard he tried, Liang Hu couldn't figure out where they had been hiding before. Moreover, the appearance of the wolves seems to be just to block their way. Are they protecting something? Could it be that there really is some witch here? \"Right in front.\" Qin Xiao said lightly, but his deep eyes were fixed on the front. He could feel that the different breath coming from the front was the person he was looking for, but the wolves appeared at this time. Could it be that the reason he was looking for at the moment came true? \"You leave first and I'll cover you.\" What he said was that Qin Xiao actually just wanted them to leave first and make his own plans. In short, it was impossible to return empty-handed today. At least he had to find out the truth. Maybe the witch they mentioned was the assassin that night. There was only one person who could control the wolves so far, but that person had disappeared for seven years. How could he appear? If it was the remaining party, it would be impossible to control it to this extent. The only possibility is also the most impossible possibility. Xiaoyao King, Bai Qianye is back. At this time, a hundred miles away from Baihu Mountain, a group of people was slowly advancing, with banners flying, as if telling the story of victory. \"Report~\" A pawn in a red uniform rode a fast horse from a distance to the front of the team, quickly jumped off the horse, and knelt on the ground with one knee. \"Report to the prince, there are a large number of hunters in the White Tiger Mountain ahead. It is said that they are encircling and suppressing the demon girl.\" The leading man frowned slightly, looked at the other side of the White Tiger Mountain, and a smile gradually climbed to the corner of his mouth. Then he issued an order, \"Go back and report to the emperor. I, King Anbang, am returning in triumph. I will pass through Baihu Mountain first. I am willing to share the worries of my emperor and surround the witch.\" \"Yes.\" After receiving the order, the soldier quickly jumped on his horse and left. \"Your Majesty, is this really okay?\" Looking at King Anbang's interested face, the man in black next to him was a little confused. Shouldn't he go back to the court to accept the reward now? Moreover, the prince, who never likes to meddle in other people's affairs, is actually going to hunt down some witch in Baihu Mountain today. It's really ridiculous. Not to mention Baihu Mountain, it is not clear whether the witch exists or not. \"Your Majesty, why is there a witch in Baihu Mountain? Could it be a rumor? Why do you need to worry about it, Your Majesty?\" The man called the Prince just narrowed his eyes, with a faint smile on his lips, and his blue clothes swayed in the wind. After a long time, he said, \"Juan Dan, you have followed me for so many years, and you still ask such a stupid question.\" Juan Dan was stunned. Although the prince's expression did not show much fluctuation, the interest in his eyes was unprecedentedly strong. He must have gone to Baihu Mountain even without the emperor's imperial edict. He was really a willful prince. He clasped his hands in fists and said respectfully, \"This subordinate is stupid, please forgive me.\" \"Anyway, Juan Dan is so stubborn, that's why he is still single in his 20th year. In my opinion, he won't enjoy it even if he throws several women to him.\" Seeing the embarrassment on Juan Dan's face, the man in green couldn't help but He stepped forward and joked, \"My lord, would you like me to go find out the truth first?\" \"Kong Qing, it's too presumptuous to speak to the prince like this.\" Although the words were reproachful, Juan Dan was not angry at all. He had long been accustomed to such teasing and would not care at all. Of course, he would not worry that the prince would be angry. \"That's why I say you're dull, but??? It must have cost a lot of money to be able to send out all the hunters in Phoenix City.\" Kong Qing walked to the front with a spear, a glimmer of light flashed in his brown eyes. \"That's the only one who can do this. Prince, can Kong Qing go first?\" Although he was asking for instructions, Kong Qing couldn't wait to rush over. Even the horse was stepping forward with its front hooves excitedly, waiting for the master's order. King Anbang knew that Kong Qing always acted impulsively. If he were to let him walk over slowly, he would probably complain all the way. It would not be impossible to cause trouble by then. That's all, it's rare that this time it went so smoothly, and he deserves a lot of credit. How about taking it as a reward? \"Juan Dan, I'll leave it to you next.\" Before Juan Dan understood the meaning of these words, the two people next to him had already whipped away and left him alone in the wind. \"Pu Chi Pu Chi\" The bird seemed to feel uneasy and waved its wings vigorously to leave this place of right and wrong. Only a few wings were left, falling to the ground, and then being picked up by the wind to continue the unknown journey. Qin Xiao, Liang Hu and others kept retreating. They had already retreated a hundred meters, but the wolves were still approaching step by step, with no attack and no tendency to give up. It's like just driving them out of the forest. There were more and more weeds around him, and Liang Hu didn't dare to retreat for a moment.", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}